---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Insights"
description: "Practical thinking on FMCG pricing, promotions, portfolio and trade strategy from the Revora team, written for the New Zealand market."
permalink: /insights/
darkHeader: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark">Insights</span>
    <h1>Notes from the trade</h1>
    <p class="lede">Practical thinking on pricing, promotions, portfolio and trade &mdash; written from the New Zealand market, for the people who work in it. No gated PDFs, no fluff.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.insights %}
      <article class="insight-card reveal">
        <a class="insight-media" href="{{ post.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
          {% if post.data.image %}
          <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
          <div class="pattern-fill">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 120 70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <rect x="8"  y="40" width="16" height="26" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.25)"/>
              <rect x="32" y="28" width="16" height="38" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.25)"/>
              <rect x="56" y="46" width="16" height="10" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)"/>
              <rect x="80" y="12" width="16" height="54" fill="#4FA57F"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        </a>
        <div class="insight-body">
          <span class="insight-tag">{{ post.data.category }}</span>
          <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
          <span class="insight-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Reading about the problem is one thing. Fixing it is more fun.</h2>
      <p>If something here sounds like your business, that's usually a good sign it's worth a conversation.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Talk to us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
